-disciples:m057-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"子張","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003898","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p057","chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m058-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"子張","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003898","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p058","chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m059-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"子張","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003898","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p059","chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m059-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"子張","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003898","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p059","chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji067-038","person_id":"cbr-p003898","surfaces":["子張","師","顓孫師"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-067-disciples"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p001","quote":"孔子曰「受業身通者七十有七人」，皆異能之士也。德行：顏淵，閔子騫，冉伯牛，仲弓。政事：冉有，季路。言語：宰我，子貢。文學：子游，子夏。師也辟，參也魯，柴也愚，由也喭，回也屢空。賜不受命而貨殖焉，億則屢中。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p056","quote":"顓孫師，陳人，字子張。少孔子四十八歳。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p040","quote":"田常欲作亂於齊，憚髙國鮑晏，故移其兵欲以伐魯。孔子聞之，謂門弟子曰：「夫魯，墳墓所處，父母之國，國危如此，二三子何爲莫出？」子路請出，孔子止之。子張、子石請行，孔子弗許。子貢請行，孔子許之。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p053","quote":"子貢問：「師與商孰賢？」子曰：「師也過，商也不及。」「然則師愈與？」曰：「過猶不及。」"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p057","quote":"子張問干祿，孔子曰：「多聞闕疑，慎言其餘，則寡尤；多見闕殆，慎行其餘，則寡悔。言寡尤，行寡悔，祿在其中矣。」"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p058","quote":"他日從在陳蔡閒，困，問行。孔子曰：「言忠信，行篤敬，雖蠻貊之國行也；言不忠信，行不篤敬，雖州里行乎哉！立則見其參於前也，在輿則見其倚於衡，夫然後行。」子張書諸紳。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p059","quote":"子張問：「士何如斯可謂之達矣？」孔子曰：「何哉，爾所謂達者？」子張對曰：「在國必聞，在家必聞。」孔子曰：「是聞也，非達也。夫達者，質直而好義，察言而觀色，慮以下人，在國及家必達。夫聞也者，色取仁而行違，居之不疑，在國及家必聞。」"}],"rationale":"依篇內明示姓名字稱及局部問答暫接。吳越王稱按夫差句踐連續敘事；第71段夫子指原憲，第90段指代未定。傳易短何分田子莊何與楊何，傳授不當父子；引古人物保留傳說性。冉季字子產不接鄭子產，原憲子思不接孔子後世子思；名錄各條同字子徒、子聲、子上、皙等均保留不同候選，鄭國是此條人名。魯昭公夫人孟子不接戰國孟子。全152段明示姓名首輪已存，未名者、代詞、版本及跨篇身份待覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p001","text":"孔子曰「受業身通者七十有七人」，皆異能之士也。德行：顏淵，閔子騫，冉伯牛，仲弓。政事：冉有，季路。言語：宰我，子貢。文學：子游，子夏。師也辟，參也魯，柴也愚，由也喭，回也屢空。賜不受命而貨殖焉，億則屢中。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003861","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0004","start":4,"end":9,"surface":"受業身通者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、氏族或未定指代，尚未補姓名及成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0017","start":17,"end":21,"surface":"異能之士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、氏族或未定指代，尚未補姓名及成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"顏淵","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003862","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"閔子騫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003863","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"冉伯牛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003864","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"仲弓","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003865","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"冉有","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003866","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"季路","kind":"person","person_id":